&lt;b&gt;FEATURES:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A sporty beach ready design and a soft nylon toe post. Sizes 9/10 and 11/12 include a heel strap.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;UPPER:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Water-resistant synthetic straps with quick-drying jersey knit lining and a soft comfortable nylon toe post.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;FOOTBED:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Anatomical compression molded EVA midsole with bushed EVA drop in footbed for personalized fit.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;OUTSOLE:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A non-marking rubber outsole features a coral reef lug design for added traction.&lt;br&gt;

BOY'S TOY STORY COWBOY BOOT SLIPPERS - Your little one will look just like Woody in his new cowboy boot slippers! These awesome costume-style slippers are available in toddler boy's sizes 5-6 M US Toddler, 7-8 M US Toddler, and 9-10 M US Toddler, as well as boy's sizes 11-12 M US Little Kid.
FEATURING HIS FAVORITE CHARACTER - These cool house shoes are sure to bring a smile to any boy's face. These plush slippers feature Disney's Toy Story character: Woody! It's the perfect footwear choice to relax or play in!
COMFORTABLE &amp; STYLISH - These slippers are made from high-quality materials. They are lightweight and soft. They include soft plush uppers, a faux fur lining on the inside, embroidered and applique graphics, cushioned footbed, and a textured sole to prevent slips. The pull tabs on the top make it easy to pull these booties on or off. For added fun, there is a felt 3D spur on the heel of each boot!&nbsp;
THE PERFECT GIFT! - Is someone's birthday coming up? Toy Story slippers make the perfect Halloween costume, birthday or Christmas gift. Why? They are comfortable, fun, and very affordable. Get your little one his own pair, or buy one for a friend! Woody slippers add some fun to bedtime! You can't find these awesome slippers anywhere else!&nbsp;
PRODUCT CARE - Caring for these slippers is easy. Wipe clean with a damp cloth.
